==Nyanko Gemini==
The Nyanko Gemini, PONOS held a limited time contest where the contestants would follow the PONOS Twitter account and post their [[Battle]] videos for a chance to win. 300 of the chosen winners would receive 3 cans of [[Cat Food]] while 5 would win a Nyanko Gemini trophy.
